00:14:34.770 --> 00:14:37.640
I have to do this. Here I come!

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:41.860
No!

00:14:42.560 --> 00:14:46.610
No! Stop it!

00:14:46.610 --> 00:14:49.030
I can't do this!

00:14:49.030 --> 00:14:49.650
Doggy?

00:14:51.660 --> 00:14:55.080
Maybe it's because he hates baths?

00:14:55.080 --> 00:14:56.120
Oh dear.

00:14:56.750 --> 00:14:58.620
Sorry, Haruna-chan.

00:14:58.620 --> 00:15:00.120
Sorry!

00:15:01.710 --> 00:15:05.420
Geez Rito... Where did you run off to play?

00:15:08.470 --> 00:15:09.340
Rito!

00:15:15.060 --> 00:15:19.100
I went through something unbelievable.

00:15:20.560 --> 00:15:22.940
Let's try a cat next time!

00:15:25.020 --> 00:15:26.980
I'm beat.

00:15:27.860 --> 00:15:32.410
But, in a way, it might have been a valuable experience.

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:39.000
Hello, Yuuki-kun, Lala-san!

00:15:39.000 --> 00:15:41.870
Haruna! You're taking your dog for a walk?

00:15:41.870 --> 00:15:42.460
Yes.

00:15:45.880 --> 00:15:47.050
Isn't he cute?

00:15:48.590 --> 00:15:49.590
No, Maron...

00:15:51.930 --> 00:15:55.970
That's too much contact{contact?}, Bro...{skinship}

00:15:54.260 --> 00:15:58.520
Stop it! Honestly, Maron...

00:15:57.760 --> 00:16:00.430
It's not easy being the family dog...

00:16:07.360 --> 00:16:12.280
Motto To LOVE-Ru 24

00:16:07.360 --> 00:16:12.280
<u>The Trance of Feelings</u>

00:16:10.940 --> 00:16:13.450
My balloon...

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:25.460
Here you go.

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:29.380
Thanks, Angel!

00:16:30.340 --> 00:16:31.920
Angel?

00:16:31.920 --> 00:16:33.550
Amazing!

00:16:34.220 --> 00:16:36.300
As expected of Yami-chan!

00:16:36.300 --> 00:16:37.930
How cool!

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:39.890
It must be nice...

00:16:39.890 --> 00:16:42.770
...I'd like to try out your Trance move.

00:16:43.560 --> 00:16:45.850
You want to...?

00:16:45.850 --> 00:16:49.520
If only I could switch bodies with you...

00:16:49.520 --> 00:16:51.400
But that's impossible.

00:16:52.900 --> 00:16:54.200
That's possible!

00:16:59.660 --> 00:17:03.540
Wow! I actually turned into Yami-chan!

00:17:05.080 --> 00:17:07.130
As expected of Maru Maru Change-kun!

00:17:07.750 --> 00:17:11.920
All right, I'm going to play around here for a bit.

00:17:11.920 --> 00:17:16.930
In that case, in your stead, I'm going home with Princess.

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:18.090
Take care! {TLC yoroshiku}

00:17:18.090 --> 00:17:18.930
All right.

00:17:20.060 --> 00:17:22.520
I'm off!

00:17:23.600 --> 00:17:25.810
Mikan looks like she's having fun!

00:17:28.100 --> 00:17:30.270
Amazing!

00:17:30.270 --> 00:17:32.650
All I have to do is think about wings...

00:17:32.650 --> 00:17:34.320
...and wings come out!

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:36.820
It feels great!

00:17:45.120 --> 00:17:47.040
Ouch...

00:17:47.040 --> 00:17:49.750
Once I lose concentration, the wings disappear.

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:52.630
If I don't get used to it, this could be difficult.

00:17:56.840 --> 00:17:59.930
So, Yami-chan, how is Mikan's body?

00:18:00.550 --> 00:18:02.180
It's an odd sensation. {TLC}

00:18:04.100 --> 00:18:06.560
Lala-chan and a beautiful girl! {TLC}

00:18:06.560 --> 00:18:08.900
This must be the red string of fate!

00:18:10.060 --> 00:18:13.110
I won't let you touch Mikan.

00:18:23.540 --> 00:18:26.620
Just as I thought, power isn't the same.

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:32.250
Oh Mikan, you're back already.

00:18:32.710 --> 00:18:33.590
Yes.

00:18:35.550 --> 00:18:36.970
What's wrong, Mikan?

00:18:36.970 --> 00:18:39.470
You look a bit different from usual.

00:18:39.470 --> 00:18:40.680
It must be your imagination.

00:18:40.680 --> 00:18:44.180
Oh... I see. That's okay, I guess...

00:18:44.560 --> 00:18:46.930
Anyway, what's for dinner?

00:18:47.810 --> 00:18:50.690
Dinner? Do I make that?

00:18:50.690 --> 00:18:53.150
Eh? You don't want to make it today?

00:18:56.110 --> 00:18:59.070
No problem. Leave it to me.

00:19:06.490 --> 00:19:08.750
Done. Eat up.

00:19:09.830 --> 00:19:11.250
Eat up.

00:19:19.010 --> 00:19:22.640
Seriously, what's wrong with Mikan today?

00:19:22.640 --> 00:19:24.930
Is she upset again?

00:19:26.390 --> 00:19:28.060
Don't come near me!

00:19:29.140 --> 00:19:34.310
Yami-chan is a bit different today! It excites me! So moe!

00:19:33.940 --> 00:19:35.570
No!

00:19:42.450 --> 00:19:46.910
She hit me with a frying pan... How pretty...

00:19:49.290 --> 00:19:51.330
What's wrong with you! Geez!

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:53.500
Yuuki Rito.

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:55.460
I found this in the bathroom.

00:19:55.460 --> 00:19:57.250
What do you use it for?

00:19:58.170 --> 00:19:59.550
What are you talking about?

00:19:59.550 --> 00:20:01.090
That's a cleaning brush.

00:20:01.090 --> 00:20:03.930
Cleaning, huh.

00:20:03.930 --> 00:20:05.470
I'll give it a go.

00:20:09.100 --> 00:20:11.270
Do you use it with this...?

00:20:12.390 --> 00:20:13.440
Mikan, hold on...

00:20:18.860 --> 00:20:20.740
You don't seem to have a fever.

00:20:21.700 --> 00:20:25.570
But I'm a bit worried, so let me do the cleaning.

00:20:25.570 --> 00:20:28.240
Just go and watch TV in the living room, Mikan.

00:20:29.910 --> 00:20:30.950
OK.

00:20:32.790 --> 00:20:35.500
No matter what it is, I will solve it! {TLC burn?}

00:20:36.290 --> 00:20:37.670
Magical Girl Kyouko.

00:20:37.670 --> 00:20:39.340
Everyone, there's no need to be afraid! {TLC}

00:20:39.340 --> 00:20:41.590
I will fight the battles. {TLC}

00:20:47.260 --> 00:20:49.720
Hey. Here's some tea, Mikan.

00:20:58.730 --> 00:20:59.730
It's so warm.

00:21:00.190 --> 00:21:02.610
Of course, I just made it.

00:21:03.820 --> 00:21:06.240
I'm not talking about the temperature of the tea.

00:21:06.240 --> 00:21:07.200
Eh?

00:21:07.870 --> 00:21:11.830
Are you always this kind?

00:21:11.830 --> 00:21:13.160
What?

00:21:13.160 --> 00:21:15.870
I have no idea what you're saying,

00:21:15.870 --> 00:21:18.920
but no matter where you are, this is how all families act, right?

00:21:22.050 --> 00:21:24.840
I... see.

00:21:32.310 --> 00:21:35.890
Even though I had a lot of problems, it was really fun.

00:21:35.890 --> 00:21:37.100
Thanks, Yami-san.

00:21:37.690 --> 00:21:42.280
Don't mention it. I also had a precious personal experience.

00:21:43.530 --> 00:21:46.990
I am a little envious of you, Mikan.

00:21:51.370 --> 00:21:52.240
Rito!

00:21:52.240 --> 00:21:53.830
What's up with this dinner?!

00:21:53.830 --> 00:21:54.950
"What's up?"

00:21:54.950 --> 00:21:57.040
You made it, right?

00:21:57.040 --> 00:21:57.830
Eh?

00:21:57.830 --> 00:21:59.040
Delicious!

00:22:15.850 --> 00:22:19.980
<b>itsumo no jikan ni machiawasete</b>

00:22:15.850 --> 00:22:19.980
<b>いつもの時間に待ち合わせて</b>

00:22:15.850 --> 00:22:19.980
<b>I'm waiting for you at the usual time,</b>

00:22:19.980 --> 00:22:23.020
<b>chikoku shite terekakushi</b>

00:22:19.980 --> 00:22:23.020
<b>遅刻して照れ隠し</b>

00:22:19.980 --> 00:22:23.020
<b>Hiding my embarrassment because I'm late.</b>

00:22:23.020 --> 00:22:27.150
<b>damari komi kimete aruki dasuno</b>

00:22:23.020 --> 00:22:27.150
<b>黙りこみ決めて歩き出すの</b>

00:22:23.020 --> 00:22:27.150
<b>I walk beside you without saying a word.</b>

00:22:27.150 --> 00:22:29.780
<b>share ni nattenai!</b>

00:22:27.150 --> 00:22:29.780
<b>シャレになってない!</b>

00:22:27.150 --> 00:22:29.780
<b>This joke is not funny.</b>

00:22:29.780 --> 00:22:36.240
<b>yume ni miteta koto konya kanai sou</b>

00:22:29.780 --> 00:22:36.240
<b>夢に見てたこと 今夜叶いそう</b>

00:22:29.780 --> 00:22:36.240
<b>What I saw in the dream might come true tonight.</b>

00:22:36.240 --> 00:22:42.290
<b>dakedo ne watashi kara janaku</b>

00:22:36.240 --> 00:22:42.290
<b>だけどね 私からじゃなく</b>

00:22:36.240 --> 00:22:42.290
<b>But you know, it shouldn't come from me.</b>

00:22:42.290 --> 00:22:49.220
<b>anata no yuuki de kime naku cha</b>

00:22:42.290 --> 00:22:49.220
<b>あなたの勇気でキメなくちゃ</b>

00:22:42.290 --> 00:22:49.220
<b>I need you to pluck up the courage to decide.</b>

00:22:49.880 --> 00:22:56.510
<b>koishiteru kono kanji</b>

00:22:49.880 --> 00:22:56.510
<b>恋してる この感じ</b>

00:22:49.880 --> 00:22:56.510
<b>Falling in love... This feeling...</b>

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:04.230
<b>romanchikkuna yume wo misasete</b>

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:04.230
<b>ロマンチックな夢を見させて</b>

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:04.230
<b>Lets us witness romantic sweet dreams.</b>

00:23:04.230 --> 00:23:12.530
<b>koishiteru kono omoi kokoro kara</b>

00:23:04.230 --> 00:23:12.530
<b>恋してる この想い 心から</b>

00:23:04.230 --> 00:23:12.530
<b>Falling in love... This feeling in my heart...</b>

00:23:12.530 --> 00:23:20.460
<b>afure dashiteru baby love</b>

00:23:12.530 --> 00:23:20.460
<b>溢れ出してる baby love</b>

00:23:12.530 --> 00:23:20.460
<b>...is overflowing with baby love.</b>

00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:39.980
Preview

00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:39.980
Preview

00:23:31.120 --> 00:23:33.300
Squids will of course, omit their own odour.

00:23:33.300 --> 00:23:34.970
Dressing up casually is a bold thing to do.

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:36.640
A kappa flowing with the water?

00:23:36.640 --> 00:23:38.930
This is the sixth child from a large family.
